 659:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief Defines the pre-dividing factor in front of the K3-Divider
 660:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  Register : PERPLLCON1.B.K3PREDIV;
 661:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  0H DIVBY1_0 / The 1.0 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 662:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.0.
 663:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  1H DIVBY1_1 / The 1.1 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 664:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.1.
 665:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  2H DIVBY1_2 / The 1.2 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 666:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.2.
 667:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  4H DIVBY1_4 / The 1.4 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 668:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.4.
 669:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  6H DIVBY1_6 / The 1.6 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 670:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.6.
 671:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  7H DIVBY1_7 / The 1.0 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 672:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 1.7.
 673:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  AH DIVBY2_0 / The 2.0 pre-divider between DCO and K3-Divider is selected.
 674:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Hence, the resulting divider factor in front of the K3-Divider is fDCO / 2.0.
 675:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  */
 676:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** typedef enum
