1617:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief API to check if Per PLL is locked, if its is locked it will return the frequency.
1618:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * This API returns 0 if the Per PLL is not locked. If it is locked it returns the frequency.
