 256:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Sdmmc/Std/IfxSdmmc.h **** /** \brief ACMD23, should be followed by CMD55, Response: R1\n
 257:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Sdmmc/Std/IfxSdmmc.h ****  * Set the number of write blocks to be pre-erased before writing (to be used for faster Multiple B
 258:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Sdmmc/Std/IfxSdmmc.h ****  * "1"=default (one wr block)
 259:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Sdmmc/Std/IfxSdmmc.h ****  */
